5. If `randomize` is `true`, randomly select an index for the item in the results array. You can use the `Math.floor(Math.random() * (max - min + 1)) + min` formula to generate a random index between 0 and `max - min`.
6. Add the item to the results array at the selected index.
7. Return the results array.

